      "writtenOn": "2019-03-27T18:12:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right. This should be if (hasEuicc \u0026\u0026 allEuiccsAreInactive \u0026\u0026 !isDefaultEuiccCardIdSet).\n\nThat means:\non 1.4 with eUICC we will set it in the loop using EID,\non 1.4 with no eUICC we set UNINITIALIZED\n\non 1.2-1.3 with active eUICC we set UNINITIALIZED (and then load from APDU)\non 1.2-1.3 with inactive eUICC with set TEMPORARILY_UNSUPPORTED\non 1.2-1.3 with no eUICC we set UNINITIALIZED",
